    "仓库准备上线整箱出库时，管理员先建立": "When the warehouse is ready to go online for full box shipment, the administrator first creates",
    "以 JSON 配置请求头，可动态带入 Tenant、Facility 和时区等调用上下文。": "Configure request headers in JSON, which can dynamically bring in calling context such as Tenant, Facility and time zone.",
    "以当前流程为基础复制一份新定义，适合新流程与现有流程大部分步骤相同的场景。": "Copy a new definition based on the current process, suitable for scenarios where the new process has the same steps as the existing process.",
    "任务仍在候选池中，Station 与 Accepted By 尚未生成。": "The task is still in the candidate pool, and Station and Accepted By have not yet been generated.",
    "任务匹配后按照已发布流程进入现场执行": "After the task is matched, enter the site for execution according to the published process.",
    "任务发生过哪些变化？": "What changes have occurred to the mission?",
