    "新实例按照启动时绑定的流程版本执行": "The new instance executes according to the process version bound at startup",
    "新的事件不再启动该流程；已经启动的 Workflow Instance 继续执行。": "New events no longer start the process; already started Workflow Instance continues to execute.",
    "新触发的流程使用更新后的 Workflow Definition；已启动实例继续使用启动时的版本快照。": "Newly triggered processes use the updated Workflow Definition; launched instances continue to use the version snapshot at startup.",
    "既可使用 actionType 等标准字段，也可使用 extensionData.skuCode 等自定义扩展字段。": "You can use either standard fields such as actionType or custom extension fields such as extensionData.skuCode.",
    "时，示例 Filter 匹配成功。后续 Job Scheduling Rule 根据这条 Filter，将任务交给周转箱出库所使用的 Workflow Definition。": ", the example Filter matches successfully. The subsequent Job Scheduling Rule assigns the task to the Workflow Definition used for the outsourcing of turnover boxes based on this Filter.",
    "暂不进入现场作业，返回 WCS 管理页面。": "Do not enter on-site operations yet and return to the WCS management page.",
    "更换 Workflow": "Replace Workflow",
    "更新站点列表和使用状态，确保选择基于最新信息。": "Update site list and usage status to ensure selections are based on the latest information.",
    "有结果时，每组会显示 APPEND 或 CREATE_NEW，说明任务将追加到现有实例还是新建流程。": "When there are results, each group will display APPEND or CREATE_NEW, indicating whether the task will be appended to an existing instance or a new process.",
    "本规则实际匹配到的任务数和分组数，用于核对 Filter 与 Grouping Attributes 是否符合预期。": "The number of tasks and groupings actually matched by this rule is used to check whether the Filter and Grouping Attributes meet expectations.",
    "查找站点": "Find site",
    "查看 Station Code、Station Name 和 Status 后，选中本次作业的站点。": "After checking the Station Code, Station Name and Status, select the station for this job.",
