    "查看每次实际启动的流程当前运行到哪里。": "View where each actually started process currently runs.",
    "查看流程的创建、更新、发布、退回草稿、停用和归档记录，用于追溯版本变化。": "View the creation, update, release, return to draft, deactivation and archive records of the process to trace version changes.",
    "查看节点结果并展开关联执行记录": "View node results and expand associated execution records",
