    "阅读指南": "Reading Guide",
    "除基础信息外，还需根据业务需要配置入参校验、搜索字段、索引映射和取消任务规则。": "In addition to basic information, input parameter verification, search fields, index mapping and task cancellation rules need to be configured according to business needs.",
    "集中查看和管理 WCS 接收到的业务任务。": "Centrally view and manage business tasks received by WCS.",
    "集中查看当前生效的调度策略": "Centrally view the currently effective scheduling policy",
    "面向业务管理人员、现场操作员及实施运维人员，说明 Orbiflow-WCS 各页面的适用场景、关键操作与业务结果。": "Designed for business managers, frontline operators, and implementation and support teams, this guide explains when to use each Orbiflow-WCS page, the key actions available, and the resulting business outcomes.",
    "页面导航": "Page Navigation",
    "页面截图放大预览": "Page screenshot enlarged preview",
    "页面操作": "Page operations",
    "页面示意": "Page diagram",
    "页面预览": "PAGE PREVIEW",
    "首次发送失败后，系统按照 Retry Interval 等待，并在 Retry Count 上限内继续尝试。": "After the first transmission fails, the system waits according to the Retry Interval and continues to try within the upper limit of the Retry Count.",
    "，并定义 WMS 下发任务需要携带的容器、工作站等业务数据。完成后，WCS 才能识别这类任务，并将其交给后续流程和调度配置处理。": ", and define the business data such as containers and workstations that need to be carried by WMS to deliver tasks. Once completed, WCS can identify such tasks and hand them over to subsequent processes and scheduling configurations.",
    "，表示只匹配周转箱出库 Job。需要进一步限定任务时，可通过 Add Condition 增加其他判断。": ", indicating that only the turnover box outbound Job is matched. When you need to further limit the task, you can add other judgments through Add Condition.",
